In addition to the microRNA package, you can try TargetScan
(www.targetscan.org). Their miRNA ID are consistent with mirBase, and
the gene IDs correspond to Entrez IDs,  which you can easily use them to
extract their sequence usin gbiomaRt. Hope this would help.

Ps:  You can download their database through
http://www.targetscan.org/cgi-bin/targetscan/data_download.cgi?db=vert_50 

