my.sub.list <- subset(my.id.list,unigene!="")

# attach unigene IDs
index <- match(test_results[,1],my.sub.list$affy_hg_u133a)
annotated.test_results <- cbind(test_results,my.sub.list$unigene[index])


I hope that helps...

Cheers,
CJ


